ail designated Publishers when a %s is submitted'=>'Firanṣẹ imeeli si awọn onkọwe ti a yan nigbati a ba fi %s ranṣẹ','Email designated Publishers when a %s is published'=>'Firanṣẹ imeeli si awọn onkọwe ti a yan nigbati a ba tẹjade %s','Email designated Publishers when a %s is approved'=>'Firanṣẹ imeeli si awọn onkọwe ti a yan nigbati a ba fọwọsi %s','Email Editors and Administrators when a %s is submitted'=>'Firanṣẹ imeeli si awọn olootu ati awọn alakoso nigbati a ba fi %s ranṣẹ','Email Editors and Administrators when a %s is published'=>'Firanṣẹ imeeli si awọn olootu ati awọn alakoso nigbati a ba tẹjade %s','Email Editors and Administrators when a %s is approved'=>'Firanṣẹ imeeli si awọn olootu ati awọn alakoso nigbati a ba fọwọsi %s','PublishPress Revisions Site Settings'=>'Ibi Eto Atunṣe PublishPress','These are the default settings for options which can be adjusted per-site.'=>'Eyi ni awọn eto aiyipada fun awọn aṣayan ti a le ṣatunṣe fun kọọkan aaye.','Use this tab to make NETWORK-WIDE changes to PublishPress Revisions settings. %s'=>'Lo taabu yii lati ṣe awọn ayipada NETWORK-WIDE si awọn eto Atunṣe PublishPress. %s','You can also specify %1$sdefaults for site-specific settings%2$s.'=>'O tun le sọ %1$saiyipada fun awọn eto aaye-pataki%2$s.','Here you can change the default value for settings which are controlled separately on each site.'=>'Nibi o le yi iye aiyipada pada fun awọn eto ti a n ṣakoso ni lọtọ ni kọọkan aaye.','Note that %1$s network-wide settings%2$s may also be available.'=>'Ṣe akiyesi pe %1$s awọn eto NETWORK-wide%2$s le tun wa.','License'=>'Iwe-aṣẹ','Past Revisions are earlier versions of a post.'=>'Awọn atunṣe ti tẹlẹ jẹ awọn ẹya ti o ti kọja ti ifiweranṣẹ kan.','This post type does not support Past Revisions.'=>'Iru ifiweranṣẹ yii ko ni atilẹyin awọn atunṣe ti tẹlẹ.','New Revisions are changes which are not yet published.'=>'Awọn atunṣe tuntun jẹ awọn ayipada ti ko ti wa ni atẹjade.','Note: Third party code may cause some post types to be incompatible with PublishPress Revisions.'=>'Akiyesi: Koodu ẹgbẹ kẹta le fa ki diẹ ninu awọn iru ifiweranṣẹ ko ni ibamu pẹlu Awọn atunṣe PublishPress.','For Revisions integration on the Content Calendar, Overview and Content Board, please update %sPublishPress Planner Pro%s.'=>'Fun isopọ awọn atunṣe lori Kalendaru Akọkọ, Akopọ ati Iboju Akọkọ, jọwọ ṣe imudojuiwọn %sPublishPress Planner Pro%s.','Ready to enhance your revision workflow?'=>'Ṣe o ti ṣetan lati mu iṣẹ ṣiṣatunkọ rẹ pọ si?','Get PublishPress Statuses Pro and optimize your revision process with custom revision statuses.'=>'Gba PublishPress Statuses Pro ki o si mu ilana atunṣe rẹ pọ si pẹlu awọn ipo atunṣe aṣa.','Define your own statuses before or after Revision Submitted'=>'Ṣe idanimọ awọn ipo tirẹ ṣaaju tabi lẹhin Atunṣe ti a fi silẹ','New predefined statuses: Deferred, Needs Work, Rejected'=>'Awọn ipo ti a ti ṣaaju: Ti a fọwọsi, Nilo Iṣẹ, Ti kọ','Statuses can be specific to a post type'=>'Awọn ipo le jẹ pato si iru ifiweranṣẹ kan','Control access to statuses per-role'=>'Ṣakoso iraye si awọn ipo nipasẹ-ipa','Status workflow can be nested with sub-statuses'=>'Ilana ipo le jẹ apapọ pẹlu awọn sub-ipo','Get PublishPress Statuses Pro'=>'Gba PublishPress Statuses Pro','Learn More'=>'Kọ ẹkọ diẹ sii','Pro Plugin'=>'Plugin Pro','Install Statuses Pro to unlock custom revision statuses.'=>'Fi Statuses Pro sori lati ṣii awọn ipo atunṣe aṣa.','Configure for any post type and role to match your editing workflow.'=>'Ṣeto fun iru ifiweranṣẹ eyikeyi ati ipa lati ba ilana ṣiṣatunkọ rẹ mu.','Get Statuses Pro'=>'Gba Statuses Pro','Maximum revisions per post:'=>'Iye to pọ julọ ti awọn atunṣe fun ifiweranṣẹ:','(unlimited)'=>'(ailewu)','Note that archiving can also be disabled by %1$sPost Type%2$s.'=>'Ṣe akiyesi pe a tun le pa arọwọto mọ́ ọ́ nipasẹ %1$sPost Type%2$s.','%s capability'=>'%s agbara','Assign capability to roles'=>'Fún agbara sí àwọn ipa','Prevent non-Administrators from restoring a revision without the %s.'=>'Dènà àwọn ti kii ṣe Alakoso lati tún ṣe atunṣe laisi %s.','Prevent non-Administrators from restoring a revision without the restore_revisions capability'=>'Dènà àwọn ti kii ṣe Alakoso lati tún ṣe atunṣe laisi agbara restore_revisions','Modification Date'=>'Ọjọ́ Àtúnṣe','Revision Creation'=>'Ìdàpọ̀ Àtúnṣe','Submission'=>'Ìkànsí','Scheduling'=>'Ṣeto','Publication'=>'Ìtẹ̀jáde','Management'=>'Ìṣàkóso','Create Revision capabilities'=>'Ṣẹda awọn agbara Àtúnṣe','Assign capabilities to roles'=>'Fún awọn agbara sí àwọn ipa','If the user can\'t edit the published post, require %s.'=>'Ti olumulo ko ba le yipada ìkànsí tí a tẹ̀jáde, beere %s.','If the user can\'t edit the published post, require Create Revision capabilities (copy_posts, copy_others_pages, etc.)'=>'Ti olumulo ko ba le yipada ìkànsí tí a tẹ̀jáde, beere Ṣẹda awọn agbara Àtúnṣe (copy_posts, copy_others_pages, ati bẹbẹ lọ.)','To expand the Pages list, assign %s.'=>'Lati fa atokọ Awọn Ojú-iwe pọ, fún %s.','Listing capabilities'=>'Àwọn agbara atokọ','To expand the Pages list, assign Listing capabilities (list_others_pages, list_published_posts, etc.)'=>'Lati fa atokọ Awọn Ojú-iwe pọ, fún Àwọn agbara atokọ (list_others_pages, list_published_posts, ati bẹbẹ lọ.)','This plugin introduces a new user role, "Revisor."'=>'Plugin yii n ṣafihan ipa olumulo titun, "Revisor."','Revision by a user who does not have the %s will cause all custom html tags to be stripped out.'=>'Àtúnṣe nipasẹ olumulo ti ko ni %s yoo fa ki gbogbo awọn ami html aṣa parẹ.','Revision by a user who does not have the unfiltered_html capability will cause all custom html tags to be stripped out.'=>'Atunṣe nipasẹ olumulo ti ko ni agbara unfiltered_html yoo fa ki gbogbo awọn ami html aṣa ti yọkuro.','Broadest compat including Elementor, Divi, Beaver Builder'=>'Ibarapọ julu julọ pẹlu Elementor, Divi, Beaver Builder','Standard storage schema for broadest 3rd party compat'=>'Iṣeto ipamọ boṣewa fun ibarapọ 3rd party julu julọ','Enhanced Revision access control with PublishPress plugins'=>'Iṣakoso wiwọle Atunṣe ti a mu dara si pẹlu awọn afikun PublishPress','In enhanced mode, a Revision\'s status is stored by standard WordPress schema. Some plugins are incompatible.'=>'Ni ipo ti a mu dara si, ipo Atunṣe kan ni a tọju nipasẹ iṣeto boṣewa WordPress. Diẹ ninu awọn afikun ko ni ibamu.','Prevent Revision creation if the post already has another Revision in progress.'=>'Dena ẹda Atunṣe ti ifiweranṣẹ ba ti ni Atunṣe miiran ni ilọsiwaju tẹlẹ.','Work around cache plugin conflicts by requerying for revisions before suppressing the New Revision link.'=>'Mura ọna yika awọn ija afikun cache nipa tun wa fun awọn atunṣe ṣaaju ki o to pa ọna asopọ Atunṣe Tuntun.','If the user does not have a regular Edit link, recaption the %s link as "Edit."'=>'Ti olumulo ko ba ni ọna asopọ Edit deede, yi akọle ọna asopọ %s pada si "Edit."','Default labels are "Not Submitted for Approval", "Submitted for Approval", "Scheduled Revision"'=>'Awọn aami aiyipada ni "Ko ti fi silẹ fun Igbekele", "Ti fi silẹ fun Igbekele", "Atunṣe ti a ti ṣeto"','Enable published content to be copied, edited, submitted for approval and managed on the %sNew Revisions%s screen.'=>'Jẹ ki akoonu ti a tẹjade jẹ ti a le daakọ, ṣiṣatunkọ, fi silẹ fun igbekele ati iṣakoso lori iboju %sAtunṣe Tuntun%s.','Submit Revision capabilities'=>'Fi awọn agbara Atunṣe silẹ','If the user can\'t edit the published post, require Submit Revision capabilities (revise_posts, revise_others_pages, etc.)'=>'Ti olumulo ko ba le ṣatunkọ ifiweranṣẹ ti a tẹjade, beere awọn agbara Fi Atunṣe silẹ (revise_posts, revise_others_pages, ati bẹbẹ lọ)','When a %s is published, update post publish date to current time.'=>'Nigbati a ba tẹjade %s, ṣe imudojuiwọn ọjọ ifiweranṣẹ si akoko lọwọlọwọ.','When a %s is published, update post modified date to current time.'=>'Nigbati a ba tẹjade %s, ṣe imudojuiwọn ọjọ ti a ṣe atunṣe ifiweranṣẹ si akoko lọwọlọwọ.','When a new revision is created by any user who is allowed to submit revisions, automatically submit it.'=>'Nigbati atunṣe tuntun ba ṣẹda nipasẹ eyikeyi olumulo ti o ni aṣẹ lati fi awọn atunṣe silẹ, fi silẹ laifọwọyi.','Auto-submit revisions if the user can directly edit the main post.'=>'Fi awọn atunṣe silẹ laifọwọyi ti olumulo ba le ṣatunkọ ifiweranṣẹ akọkọ taara.','This allows immediate approval within the Compare screen. If disabled, a Preview link is provided instead.'=>'Eyi gba igbanwọ lẹsẹkẹsẹ laarin iboju Ẹgbẹ. Ti a ko ba mu, a funni ni ọna asopọ Àwòrán dipo.','If a currently published post or page is edited and a future date set, the change will not be applied until the selected date.'=>'Ti ifiweranṣẹ tabi oju-iwe ti a tẹjade lọwọlọwọ ba jẹ atunṣe ati ọjọ iwaju ti ṣeto, iyipada naa kii yoo lo titi di ọjọ ti a yan.','Publish scheduled revisions using the WP-Cron mechanism. On some sites, publication will fail if this setting is disabled.'=>'Tẹjade awọn atunṣe ti a ṣeto nipa lilo ilana WP-Cron. Lori diẹ ninu awọn aaye, ifiweranṣẹ yoo kuna ti a ko ba mu eto yii ṣiṣẹ.','Publish scheduled revisions asynchronously, via a secondary http request from the server.  This is usually best since it eliminates delay, but some servers may not support it.'=>'Tẹjade awọn atunṣe ti a ṣeto ni aiyara, nipasẹ ibeere http keji lati ọdọ olupin. Eyi jẹ nigbagbogbo dara julọ nitori o yọkuro idaduro, ṣugbọn diẹ ninu awọn olupin le ma ni atilẹyin rẹ.','The WP-Cron trigger is disabled, but scheduled tasks are still excecuted using a custom trigger.'=>'Ibi ija WP-Cron ti wa ni pipade, ṣugbọn awọn iṣẹ ti a ṣe eto ṣi n ṣiṣẹ pẹlu iṣaaju aṣa.','Caption the button as either "Approve and Publish" or "Approve and Schedule."'=>'Fi ọrọ akọle bọtini si "Fọwọsi ati Ṣe atẹjade" tabi "Fọwọsi ati Ṣeto."','This may improve compatibility with some plugins.'=>'Eyi le mu ibamu pọ pẹlu diẹ ninu awọn afikun.','Control New Revisions access with the %s.'=>'Ṣakoso iraye si Awọn Atunṣe Tuntun pẹlu %s.','Control New Revisions access with the manage_revision_queue capability.'=>'Ṣakoso iraye si Awọn Atunṣe Tuntun pẹlu agbara manage_revision_queue.','Users will need the %s to edit others\' Unsubmitted Revisions.'=>'Awọn olumulo yoo nilo %s lati ṣe atunṣe Awọn Atunṣe ti a ko fi silẹ ti awọn miiran.','Users will need the manage_unsubmitted_revisions capability to edit others\' Unsubmitted Revisions.'=>'Awọn olumulo yoo nilo agbara manage_unsubmitted_revisions lati ṣe atunṣe Awọn Atunṣe ti a ko fi silẹ ti awọn miiran.','If the user can\'t edit the published post, require the %s.'=>'Ti olumulo ko ba le ṣe atunṣe ifiweranṣẹ ti a tẹjade, beere %s.','If the user can\'t edit the published post, require the edit_others_revisions capability.'=>'Ti olumulo ko ba le ṣe atunṣe ifiweranṣẹ ti a tẹjade, beere agbara edit_others_revisions.','If the user can\'t edit the published post, require the list_others_revisions capability.'=>'Ti olumulo ko ba le ṣe atunṣe ifiweranṣẹ ti a tẹjade, beere agbara list_others_revisions.','Bypass the above restrictions for others\' revisions to logged in user\'s own posts.'=>'Foju kọ awọn ihamọ loke fun awọn atunṣe ti awọn miiran si awọn ifiweranṣẹ ti olumulo ti forukọsilẹ.','Regenerate "post has revision" flags'=>'Tun ṣẹda awọn asia "ifiweranṣẹ ni atunṣe"','Apply this maintenance operation if Has Revision labels on Posts / Pages screens mismatch the New Revisions listing.'=>'Lo iṣẹ itọju yii ti awọn aami Has Revision lori awọn iboju Ifiweranṣẹ / Awọn Oju-iwe ko baamu pẹlu atokọ Awọn Atunṣe Tuntun.','For enhanced notifications, install %sPublishPress Planner%s.'=>'Fun awọn iwifunni ti o ni ilọsiwaju, fi %sPublishPress Planner%s sii.','For enhanced notifications, update %sPublishPress Planner%s.'=>'Fun awọn iwifunni ti o ni ilọsiwaju, ṣe imudojuiwọn %sPublishPress Planner%s.','Send revision action notifications using the customizable %1$sPublishPress Planner Notifications system%2$s.'=>'Ran awọn iwifunni iṣe atunṣe ranṣẹ nipa lilo %1$sIṣakoso Iwifunni PublishPress%s ti o le ṣe adani%2$s.','Upgrade to Revisions Pro to send revision action notifications using the customizable %1$sPublishPress Planner Notifications system%2$s.'=>'Ṣe igbesoke si Revisions Pro lati ran awọn iwifunni iṣe atunṣe ranṣẹ nipa lilo %1$sIṣakoso Iwifunni PublishPress%s ti o le ṣe adani%2$s.','Users matching Planner > Notifications configuration get revision notifications only if they can edit the published post.'=>'Awọn olumulo ti o baamu pẹlu iṣeto Planner > Awọn iwifunni nikan gba awọn iwifunni atunṣe ti wọn ba le ṣe atunṣe ifiweranṣẹ ti a tẹjade.','Never'=>'Kankan','By default'=>'Nipasẹ aiyipada','Always'=>'Nigbagbogbo','select recipients'=>'yan awọn olugba','To avoid notification failures, buffer emails for delayed sending once minute, hour or day limits are exceeded'=>'Lati yago fun awọn ikuna ifitonileti, fi awọn imeeli pamọ fun fifiranṣẹ pẹ̀lú àkókò kan, wakati tabi ọjọ ti kọja','Notification Buffer'=>'Iboju Ifitonileti','Notification Log'=>'Iwe Itan Ifitonileti','Purge Notification Buffer'=>'Pa Iboju Ifitonileti','Truncate Notification Log'=>'Ge Iwe Itan Ifitonileti','Sent in last minute: %d / %d'=>'Ti a ranṣẹ ni iṣẹju to kẹhin: %d / %d','Sent in last hour: %d / %d'=>'Ti a ranṣẹ ni wakati to kẹhin: %d / %d','Sent in last day: %d / %d'=>'Ti a ranṣẹ ni ọjọ to kẹhin: %d / %d','Seconds until next buffer processing time: %d'=>'Awọn aaya titi de akoko processing iboju to nbọ: %d','Show Notification Log / Buffer'=>'Fihan Iwe Itan Ifitonileti / Iboju','Show with message content'=>'Fihan pẹlu akoonu ifiranṣẹ','Ready to enhance your revision notifications?'=>'Ṣe o ti ṣetan lati mu awọn ifitonileti atunṣe rẹ pọ si?','Upgrade to Revisions Pro for integration with our PublishPress Planner Notifications framework.'=>'Gbadun si Revisions Pro fun iṣọpọ pẹlu ipilẹ Ifitonileti PublishPress Planner wa.','Customize notification message and subject'=>'Ṣatunṣe ifiranṣẹ ifitonileti ati akọle','Notify for a specific post type, category or term'=>'Kọ ifitonileti fun iru ifiweranṣẹ kan, ẹka tabi ọrọ kan','Target specific roles, users, or user groups'=>'Kọja awọn ipa, awọn olumulo, tabi awọn ẹgbẹ olumulo kan','With PublishPress Planner Pro, send notifications to a Slack channel'=>'Pẹlu PublishPress Planner Pro, ran awọn ifitonileti si ikanni Slack kan','Pro Feature'=>'Iṣẹ Pro','Upgrade to Revisions Pro to unlock Planner Notifications integration.'=>'Ṣe àtúnṣe sí Revisions Pro láti ṣí i ṣe pọ̀ pẹlu ìkìlọ̀ olùṣàkóso.','Customize notification content and recipients for each notification type.'=>'Ṣe àtúnṣe akoonu ìkìlọ̀ àti àwọn olùgbani fún ọkọọkan irú ìkìlọ̀.','Some themes may block revision preview.'=>'Diẹ ninu awọn akori le dènà àwòrán àtúnṣe.','Published Post Slug'=>'Àkíyèsí Ìwé Tí a tẹjáde','Revision Slug'=>'Àkíyèsí Àtúnṣe','Revision ID only'=>'ID Àtúnṣe nikan','Some themes or plugins may require Revision Slug or Revision ID link type for proper template loading and field display.'=>'Diẹ ninu awọn akori tabi awọn afikun le nilo Àkíyèsí Àtúnṣe tabi ID Àtúnṣe irú asopọ fún ìkànsí àtẹ̀jáde to pe àti àfihàn ààyè.','The revision preview argument is configured by constant definition: %s'=>'Ìjápọ̀ àwòrán àtúnṣe ni a ṣàtúnṣe nipasẹ ìtẹ́numọ́ àìlera: %s','Adjust preview links to use "rv_preview" argument instead of "preview". Experiment to see which works best with your theme.'=>'Ṣe àtúnṣe àwọn ìjápọ̀ àwòrán láti lo "rv_preview" àjùmọ̀ṣe dipo "preview". Ṣe ìdánwò láti rí eyi tí o ṣiṣẹ́ dára jùlọ pẹ̀lú akori rẹ.','Some themes may require this setting for correct revision preview display.'=>'Diẹ ninu awọn akori le nilo àtúnṣe yii fún àfihàn àwòrán àtúnṣe to pẹ̀lú.','This should usually be enabled, except to work around conflicts with other another plugin\'s postmeta data.'=>'Eyi yẹ ki o maa jẹ́ kí o ṣiṣẹ́, ayafi ti o ba jẹ́ láti yáà awọn ìpalẹ̀pọ̀ pẹ̀lú data postmeta ti afikun mìíràn.','If the user can\'t publish, require the %s to edit others\' unpublished Posts.'=>'Tí olùṣàkóso kò le tẹjáde, bẹ̀rẹ̀ %s láti ṣe àtúnṣe àwọn Ìwé Tí a kò tẹjáde.','If the user can\'t publish, require the edit_others_drafts capability to edit others\' unpublished Posts.'=>'Tí olùṣàkóso kò le tẹjáde, bẹ̀rẹ̀ ẹ̀ka edit_others_drafts láti ṣe àtúnṣe àwọn Ìwé Tí a kò tẹjáde.','If post-specific permissions restrict or expand access to a post, apply those permissions to its revisions also.'=>'Tí ìmúlò àṣẹ-ìwé kan dènà tàbí fa àkóso sí ìwé kan, lo àwọn àṣẹ wọ̀nyí sí àwọn àtúnṣe rẹ̀ pẹ̀lú.','Rank Math SEO may prevent Revision update on some sites.'=>'Rank Math SEO le dènà àtúnṣe àtúnṣe lórí diẹ ninu awọn aaye.','WPML Translation Management'=>'Ìṣàkóso Ìtẹ̀jáde WPML','Sync "Needs Update" flags'=>'Sínk "N nilo Àtúnṣe" àmi','Set "Needs Update" for any post with translations which was updated (possibly by revision approval) more recently than its translations.'=>'Ṣeto "N nilo Àtúnṣe" fún gbogbo ìwé pẹ̀lú ìtẹ̀jáde tí a ṣe àtúnṣe (bí ó ti ṣeé ṣe nípasẹ̀ ìmúlẹ̀ àtúnṣe) laipẹ́ ju ìtẹ̀jáde rẹ̀ lọ.','Show descriptive captions for PublishPress Revisions settings.'=>'Fihàn àwọn àkọlé alaye fún ìtọ́sọ́nà PublishPress Revisions.','Plugin settings, New Revisions contents and related data will be deleted, but only after the last copy of Revisions / Revisions Pro is deleted.'=>'Àwọn àtọkasi afikun, akoonu Àtúnṣe Tuntun àti data to ní í ṣe pẹ̀lú yóò parẹ, ṣùgbọ́n nígbà tí a parẹ̀ ẹ̀dá ikẹhin ti Àtúnṣe / Revisions Pro.','Unlock Pro Integrations'=>'Ṣí iṣọpọ Pro','Upgrade to the Pro version for optimal compatibility and prompt, professional support.'=>'Ṣàtúnṣe sí ẹya Pro fún ibamu to peye àti atilẹyin ọjọ́gbọn, tó yara.','Admin'=>'Alakoso','Builder'=>'Olùkọ́','Cache'=>'Kẹ́ẹ̀kù','E-Commerce'=>'Iṣowo Ayelujara','Fields'=>'Àwọn ààyè','Multilingual'=>'Ọ̀rọ̀ méjì','SEO'=>'SEO','Workflow'=>'Ilana iṣẹ́','Specify which PublishPress Revisions Settings to control network-wide. Unselected settings are controlled separately on each site.'=>'Ṣàpèjúwe àwọn Eto Ìyípadà PublishPress wo ni láti ṣakoso ní gbogbo nẹ́tíwọ́ọ̀kì. Àwọn eto tí a ko yan ni a máa ṣakoso ní pàtó ní gbogbo aaye.','network-wide control of "%s"'=>'ìṣakoso nẹ́tíwọ́ọ̀kì ti "%s"'